# The Kind Cardian (jeuno 8): Apururu (Windurst Woods), Monberaux (Upper Jeuno), Panta-Putta, Naruru, Teigero-Bangero
# (Lower Jeuno); call-only. The Wonder Magic Set, Cook's Pride and The Lost Cardian completed, this quest accepted and
# Two of Swords given (GM: The Lost Cardian's completion does both). Can Cardians Cry? accepted (GM; Windurst group 22,
# still Lua in Apururu's script): it shows where her script falls through to it. A WAR 75.
# Turns: Apururu's default 274 and Teigero-Bangero's 34 take the first turn; each script talk follows a default talk.
# Apururu 392: options 0 and 2 nothing; option 1 the var 1; 393. A pebble: no card: Can Cardians Cry?'s arm: nothing.
# The Ten of Cups card with the Bruised Starfruit (npcUtil.tradeHas): 397, ahead of Can Cardians Cry?'s 325 (which the
# starfruit meets): Two of Swords taken, the var 2, Windurst fame +30, the card taken (the starfruit kept). The
# starfruit alone: Can Cardians Cry?'s 325, which completes it. 398.
# The var 5 (GM): her script plays nothing (not Can Cardians Cry?'s 330); the lookup then plays her 274. Monberaux:
# The Lost Cardian not completed (GM): no arm (109, 28); completed: 32, 28. Naruru 71, Teigero-Bangero 66 while accepted. Panta-Putta 35 refused on a full
# inventory, then Bringer of Bliss, Two of Swords taken (already gone), the var 0, a Green Cape, fame +13 x3,
# completed (Quest[3][8]Prog 1 (GM) kept: the raw player:completeQuest). Completed: Panta-Putta 76, Naruru 72,
# Teigero-Bangero 67; Monberaux: no quest arm (28).
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=-10.5,-2.75,15.9 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.TheWonderMagicSet completed
quest Jeuno.CooksPride completed
quest Jeuno.TheLostCardian completed
quest Jeuno.TheKindCardian accepted
quest Windurst.CanCardiansCry accepted
keyitem TwoOfSwords
item TenOfCupsCard
item Pebble
item BruisedStarfruit
login
trigger Apururu                         # the turn: her default 274
finish
trigger Apururu                         # accepted, the var 0: 392
finish option=0                         # nothing
trigger Apururu                         # the turn: 274
finish
trigger Apururu                         # 392
finish option=2                         # nothing
trigger Apururu                         # the turn: 274
finish
trigger Apururu                         # 392
finish option=1                         # the var 1
trigger Apururu                         # the turn: 274
finish
trigger Apururu                         # the var 1: 393
finish
trade Apururu Pebble x1                 # no card: Can Cardians Cry?'s arm: no starfruit: nothing
trade Apururu TenOfCupsCard x1 BruisedStarfruit x1 # accepted, the card among the items: 397 (first: Can Cardians Cry?'s 325 also holds)
finish                                  # Two of Swords taken; the var 2; Windurst fame +30; the card taken (confirmTrade), the starfruit kept
trade Apururu BruisedStarfruit x1       # no card: Can Cardians Cry?'s 325
finish                                  # Can Cardians Cry? completed (5000 gil, title); the starfruit taken
trigger Apururu                         # the turn: 274
finish
trigger Apururu                         # the var 2: 398
finish
charvar theKindCardianVar 5
trigger Apururu                         # the turn: 274
finish
trigger Apururu                         # accepted, the var 5: her script plays nothing (not Can Cardians Cry?'s 330); the lookup's 274
finish-if-event
charvar theKindCardianVar 2
warp -40.9,-0.5,-1.9 UpperJeuno         # beside Monberaux
quest Jeuno.TheLostCardian available    # GM
trigger Monberaux                       # The Lost Cardian not completed: no arm: 109 (28 queued)
finish
finish
quest Jeuno.TheLostCardian completed    # GM
trigger Monberaux                       # The Lost Cardian completed, accepted: 32 (28 queued)
finish
finish
warp -53.2,-0.1,-139.5 LowerJeuno       # beside Naruru
trigger Naruru                          # Cook's Pride completed, this quest not completed: 71
finish
trigger Teigero-Bangero                 # the turn: 34
finish
trigger Teigero-Bangero                 # accepted: 66
finish
fill-inventory
trigger Panta-Putta                     # accepted, the var 2: 35
finish                                  # no free slot: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED (13596); nothing else
free-inventory
charvar Quest[3][8]Prog 1               # a GM: the quest's own var (the raw completeQuest keeps it)
trigger Panta-Putta                     # 35
finish                                  # Bringer of Bliss; Two of Swords taken; var 0; Green Cape; fame +13 x3; completed
trigger Panta-Putta                     # completed: 76
finish
trigger Naruru                          # completed: 72
finish
trigger Teigero-Bangero                 # the turn: 34
finish
trigger Teigero-Bangero                 # completed: 67
finish
warp -40.9,-0.5,-1.9 UpperJeuno
trigger Monberaux                       # completed: no quest arm: 28
finish
